  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0ca23d3e41cd5424c9ec72c610ef25a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: Skuldafn
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d0c7e6e02081ef145a5f9d29590789ea, type: 2}
    dialog: This is far as I can take you. Krif voth ahkrin.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988565371781159
    - rid: 4927988565371781160
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d0c7e6e02081ef145a5f9d29590789ea, type: 2}
    dialog: I will look for your return, or Alduin's.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988590059192372
    - rid: 4927988590059192373
    - rid: 4927988590059192374
    - rid: 4927988590059192377
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: With his final scripted remarks out of the way, Odahviing flies off to...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Somewhere else, I guess.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: It's possible he's heading up to the Throat of the World, since he's
      there for the ending sequence.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Not that it matters to me right now, I've a portal to enter.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: If I remember right, this place is a doozy, even for characters that
      are properly leveled.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: And I'm pretty sure that if I <i>could</i> check, I would be seriously
      underleveled.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Also, I'm still rocking the armor I got from Helgen.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: All in all? My odds are pretty bad.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: At least I know the level layout!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Since that's the only thing I've got going for me, I should probably
      just try to sneak or run past the enemies.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Except for the Dragon Priest waiting for me at the end...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Meh! I'll cross that bridge when I get there!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: First, I need to sneak past that draugr patrolling the ramparts.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I'll let him do his path for a bit...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988638874599478
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Okay, based on his movements, I should be able to sneak up to the right
      side of the second arch.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Once there, I can wait for him to move his way to the left...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: And while he's facing the other direction I can sneak behind that pillar...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Alright!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988638874599424
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Up those stairs is an elevated platform with a handful of draugr guarding
      it.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Unfortunately, it's very wide open; no room to hide.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: There's nothing from stopping me climbing up that cliff face to my right,
      is there?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Other than wonky Skyrim collisions, which isn't exactly a problem for
      a person that actually has functional limbs and isn't just a character controller.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Alright, let's see if I can get a good grip...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988638874599480
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Minor inconveniences aside, this should be doable...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Alright, I'm up.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988638874599481
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: And behind a conveniently placed decorative pillar.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I got a good view from up here...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Ah! I should be able to drop down to the entrance of the temple from
      up here.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: How will I get there unnoticed...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Since there's no draugr up here, I should be able to make it over by
      going prone and crawling...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Temple entrance in sight... guarded by a draugr wight.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988638874599482
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Phooey.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: He's just standing around...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Hm. What can I even do...?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: There's this big pile of rubble in front of me, with some loose rocks
      that'd be easy enough to throw...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I might be able to distract him by throwing it...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: But, there's also these weird trench-thingies to the sides of the stairs...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Why are they even here?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ... maybe they used to be some sort of water fixture?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Not that their purpose matters to me; I might be able to use one of them
      to go prone again...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Plan concocted!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I throw the rock to get him looking to my right, then use the time afforded
      to get in position at the leftmost trench.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Skyrim NPCs usually take their time investigating sounds, so I should
      be able to sneak my way up the trench.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Even if he does turn around, I should be slightly covered up by the trench...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Alright here goes nothing...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Rock thrown...!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360475574796487
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: The draugr is investigating where the rock fell...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: And we're in!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988638874599484
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I'm doing pretty good so far.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ... I just jinxed myself, didn't I...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: There's a draugr at the end of this hallway.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: While there are plenty of little nooks and crannies I should be able
      to use to get further through-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: There isn't really an obvious way to slip past him.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: First, I'll slowly sneak of to that alcove on my right and see if anything
      presents itself from there.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988656138616884
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: This overturned pillar would be able to keep me out of view if the draugr
      walked in my direction...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: But there's nothing here that would be able to easily catch his attention-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: There's a few loose blocks and rocks, but they're huge!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: The "Throw Voice" shout would be <i>really</i> convenient right about
      now...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988656138616885
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988656138616886
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ... maybe a septim would work?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I'd have to make sure he's not looking in my direction when I throw it,
      <i>and</i> throw it hard enough to be heard.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ... not exactly the best use of my money, I admit-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: But, if I think about it in terms of healthcare costs prevented, throwing
      out a septim is a great deal!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Let's see where he's looking...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Now's my chance!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: -!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360475574796488
    - rid: 4927988656138616902
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Draugr's moving closer...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Moment of truth...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: And he walks past me to check out where I threw the coin!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Phew...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I should be able to slip past now-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988656138616888
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Sneak Increased to 11
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360475574796489
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Hm. I remember there being draugr in this room, but there doesn't seem
      to be any.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Odd...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I haven't really ever done this place through just stealth like this
      before-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: But playstyle doesn't affect enemy spawns in the game, so...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Weird.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I'll take it though; it'd probably be really annoying, maybe impossible,
      to do this spinny puzzle while sneaking around.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: That should be every pillar in their correct orientation.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988656138616890
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Now to pull the lever-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Gate opened.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988656138616891
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I'm pretty sure I need to head through that coffin straight ahead...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Which only opens up to reveal a draugr when I approach it...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: And that's ignoring the draugr by the ceremonial table who would notice
      me if I just took the stairs...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: All things considered?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: This room can't be solved with stealth.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Might as well take the opportunity to get a plan before I blow my cover.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Wait a minute, I'm the dragonborn!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I'll just use Whirlwind Sprint to make it to the coffin without dealing
      with the draugr by the table-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 'And then use a full Unrelenting Force to just knock the coffin draugr
      out of the way. '
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I might get some unwanted attention, but I should be able to just run
      until I find a hiding spot.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Or just run to the end.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Whichever works.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Here goes nothing...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: <font=dragonfont>wuld</font>!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360475574796490
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c0b39cfaa176e01408a7233c1c790dda, type: 2}
    dialog: '!!!'
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: C'mon coffin draugr, I don't have all day-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c0b39cfaa176e01408a7233c1c790dda, type: 2}
    dialog: d7 vol1n!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360475574796491
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Thar he blows!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: <font=dragonfont>fus ro d4</font>!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360475574796492
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: And thar he goes!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Okay, looking behind me, I can't see the two draugr I've alerted.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988656138616895
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Now I just have to-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988656138616896
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: To...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: <NoiseText=0.5,0.5>Oh no</NoiseText>...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988656138616897
    - rid: 4927988656138616898
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: S-s-spiders...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: They're c-crawling toward me...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: <font=dragonfont><NoiseText=1,1>fus ro d4</NoiseText></font>!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360475574796493
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: <font=dragonfont>wuld n4 kest</font>!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360475574796494
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988656138616904
    - rid: 4927988656138616905
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Behind me? No spiders...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: In front of me? No spiders...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: To my left? No spiders...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: To my right?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Oh. No spiders; could've sworn I saw something...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: <i>Phew</i>...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988656138616906
    - rid: 4927988656138616907
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I forgot about those...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Good thing the thu'um works on them too! Ahaha!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Ahaha... haaaahh...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: God, I hate those things-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Ah crap!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: There's a draugr walking toward the stairway ahead-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Gotta slip into this brazier's alcove-!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I don't think he saw me...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Alright, how best should I approach this-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: He just walked right past me...?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Uh, what's he doing-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Oh, is he looking for the source of the shouting?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I guess that makes sense...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Hm. But if he heard me, others probably did too.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Alright, I should keep going forward, then.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Ideally, I just hop from cover to cover without getting spotted-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: But if I <i>do</i> get caught, it'd be better to be caught as far in
      as possible.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: That way I don't have to spend as much energy running to the portal.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Although, I could just spam Whirlwind Sprint, since I don't have the
      cooldown-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988656138616908
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: There's footsteps up that spiral staircase-!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Place to hide, place to hide-!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Up along the brick wall by the debris?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I think that's as out-of-view as I can get in here...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Assuming that they just look straight ahead...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: But, to be fair, if they use their peripheral vision at all, I'm boned
      anywhere.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Pun not intended.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988656138616909
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: One draugr-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Two draugr-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Three draugr...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ... I think that's all of them for now.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Gotta make it up those stairs while I still have time-!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I've managed to give another handful of draugr the slip.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988656138616910
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: My banana peel impression has gotten pretty good, I'd say!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: '"<color=#713BB0>Um... {mc}? I don''t get it.</color>"'
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: '"<color=#FF94F6>That was lame, {mc}.</color>"'
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: '"<color=#3BC1FF>... I thought it was funny...</color>"'
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: See? Sayori liked my joke-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ... I think all this sneaking has taken a toll on me.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Not that I <i>can</i> sneak anymore-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988656138616911
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: The only way I'm getting the dragon claw for that door is to take down
      the draugr wight holding it-!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988656138616912
    - rid: 4927988656138616913
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988699465252921
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988699465252924
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988699465252925
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Alright, now let's open that door...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988699465252920
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Oh yeah. A word wall.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988699465252928
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: And lo, did mighty Heimverlund come from the brutal north, like a <SineText=5>storm</SineText>
      of unbridled vengeance from Sovngarde itself.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Who the hell is Heimverlund?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Whatever, now I know the first part of Storm Call.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Not that it'll be of great use to me, since I don't have the dragon souls
      to unlock it.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ... Assuming I still need those?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: All the other shouts I've learned so far I've gotten straight from the
      Graybeard's knowledge, so...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Huh.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Open air!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988699465252929
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: A quick scan to my left and right for enemies...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: And we're good!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: The portal should be right to my left...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: There it is, just up these stairs...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988699465252930
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: No point in sneaking here either, I probably wouldn't be able to move
      fast enough before the Dragon Priest closes the portal.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Just have to get in there and throw hands-!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1ebe6e9bf1abe00478080a385f267545, type: 2}
    dialog: Alduin will reward me for your death!
    ScreenActions:
