  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Dragon priest... down...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988699465252936
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Alright. Now all I have to do is stick his staff back into its place.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988699465252938
    - rid: 4927988699465252939
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ... wow...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: The seventh generation of consoles did not do this justice; it's mesmerizing...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I don't have the time to enjoy this, I've a World-Eater to slay.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Hopefully this won't feel too weird...
    ScreenActions: []
